.ends LMV358

VPOS vp 0 5
VMID mid 0 2.5
VIN inp mid AC 1
LFB out inn 1G
CFB inn mid 1G
RL out mid 10000
CL out mid 2e-10
Rpark1 park1 mid 100k
XDUT vp 0 inp inn mid park1 out park1 LMV358

.ac dec 20 0.1 1G
.meas ac m_a0__db find vdb(out) at=0.1
.meas ac m_a0__ph find vp(out) at=0.1
.meas ac m_ugf WHEN vm(out)=1 fall=1
.meas ac m_ph__db find vdb(out) WHEN vm(out)=1 fall=1
.meas ac m_ph__ph find vp(out) WHEN vm(out)=1 fall=1
.control
run
.endc
